I built the issue desk as a single `src/main.rx` in `/tmp/claude-0/runs/r15/desk9-rx-haiku-3/src/`, and `./check` passes with all 30 visible tests green; I used 11 of the 15 check/test runs. I'm least sure of three things the hidden tests might probe. The label input and add button are only shown once the labels have loaded. Accepted posts, labels and closes rely on a refresh or the open count's client-side state rather than a re-ask, so a hidden test that never answers a re-ask may see different counts. And the related-hit handoff depends on keeping the help results inside a `loading` region to avoid a hold on the page switch.